
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant VCI as VirtualCorrelatorInterface
    participant Sec as SecurityManager
    participant Master as MasterController
    participant Slave as SlaveController
    participant HW as HardwareDriver
    participant Watchdog as WatchdogService

    Note over User, Watchdog: System Initialization
    Master->>Master: initialize()
    Slave->>Slave: heartbeat()
    Master->>Slave: register_slave()
    Watchdog->>Master: monitor()

    Note over User, Watchdog: Configuration Flow
    User->>VCI: login(credentials)
    VCI->>Sec: authenticate()
    Sec-->>VCI: token
    User->>VCI: configure_correlator(config)
    VCI->>Sec: authorize(role, resource)
    Sec-->>VCI: allowed
    VCI->>Master: broadcast_command(config)
    Master->>Slave: execute_command(config)
    Slave->>HW: write_registers(data)
    HW-->>Slave: success
    Slave-->>Master: status_report
    Master-->>VCI: result
    VCI-->>User: response
    VCI->>Sec: audit_log(action, user)

    Note over User, Watchdog: Fault Recovery Flow
    Slave->>Watchdog: heartbeat_missed
    Watchdog->>Watchdog: trigger_recovery(Slave)
    Watchdog->>Slave: reboot_command()
    Slave->>Slave: restart_service()
    Slave->>Master: re_register()
    Master->>VCI: status_update(FaultResolved)
